// cosmic-cinderday - Telegram Desktop colour scheme for the COSMIC Cinder Day rice
// Ash, coal text, orange accent, sage for online / outgoing / success,
// brick only where Telegram marks something wrong.
// Build the theme file with ./build.sh, then in Telegram:
// Settings -> Chat Settings -> Chat wallpaper -> Choose from file.
// Generated from the rice palette over Telegram's night theme (v7.3.1 keyset).
// Keys left out keep Telegram's own colours
